# Piper voice models: downloaded, not authored, and en_US-ryan-high.onnx is
# 115 MB — past GitHub's hard 100 MB per-file limit, so tracking it would make
# the push fail. Fetch them with:
#   uv run python -m piper.download_voices en_US-ryan-high --data-dir voices/
voices/
